  "body": "At TPAC, we discussed the use of streams in fetch.  The problem of having to rely on the default implementation of `tee()` is that this introduces the potential need for an infinite buffer.  If the JS were able to provide a tee implementation that didn't depend on creating a clone, that would be significantly more performant.\n",
